    "objects": "Literal normalized mu=volume.tilted(-V), true unreflected R_s=mu.tilted(-norm(x-y_s)^2/(2eta_s)); actual unique proximal p; standardized affine r_s; true smooth Bregman rho; gamma=stdGaussian E; actual canonical ENNReal KL and smooth-rho gradient Fisher integral. Internally q=e^-rho/Z and f=e^-rho/2/sqrtZ must be the same definitions/witness.",
