    "Obtain actual33 measurable unique stationary p and actual32 produced p32; prove p32_s=p_s from same stationarity and actual33 uniqueness for every s.",
    "Transport literal rho and standardized r and actual Z/q/f across equality, not equality of opaque existential selectors by assumption; R uses the same literal true posterior law.",
    "Use actual32 true probability/positiveZ/qmass1/f²=q/C2/fL2/gradientfL2/qlogqL1/scoreL2 and exact energyquarter, all actual domains internally.",
    "Use actual33 canonical ENNRealKL finite and toReal=qlogq integral at SAME p/r/q; selected llr equality only AE, never differentiate canonical selected RN.",
    "Apply actual42 to the raw noncompact f with its genuinely produced domains; rewrite f²=q and mass=1 so masslogmass is zero, including rank0.",
    "Combine exact2 functionLSI and actual1/4 gradient energy identity to obtain finite KL.toReal<=1/2 true smooth-rho Fisher integral.",
    "Return one common measurable witness and all actual outputs for every eta_s>0; do not add T2/W2/fullFIRST/fullW12/main/cost or Markov-family conclusions."
  ],
